  "prefLabel": "We 207.04 Record",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 207.04 Record.\n\n(a) A record of the hearing shall be kept by tape recording or other method which will provide a verbatim record.\n\n(b) Copies of the recording shall be provided to any person upon request and payment of the costs of the tape(s).\n\nSource. #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9178-A, eff 6-13-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/we100-1000.html"
